        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "## Problem Statement\r\nTo facilitate the efficient redistribution of surplus food, Anndaata Connect needs a registration page specifically for donors. This page will enable restaurants, event organizers, and individuals to create accounts and start donating their surplus food through the platform.\r\n\r\n## Proposed Solution\r\nCreate a registration page for donors with the following features:\r\n- Sign-Up Form: Collects necessary information including:\r\n  - Full Name\r\n  - Email\r\n  - Password (with confirmation)\r\n  - Phone Number\r\n  - Organization Name (optional)\r\n  - Address\r\n  - Food Safety Agreement Checkbox\r\n- Input Validation: Ensure all required fields are filled out and valid (e.g., email format, password strength).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
